  "turns": [
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0001",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 0.98,
      "end_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Thanks for calling Westline Customer Care. This is Daniel. How can I help you?",
      "word_count": 14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0002",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 6.06,
      "end_seconds": 12.44,
      "text": "Hey, Daniel. This is Ethan Patel. Um, I think I actually spoke with you yesterday about some missing headphones.",
      "word_count": 19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0003",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 14.3,
      "end_seconds": 19.47,
      "text": "Oh, okay. That's awesome, yeah. Um, I remember that case. Uh, did the package turn up?",
      "word_count": 17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0004",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 20.62,
      "end_seconds": 30.54,
      "text": "Uh, no, not yet. Uh, but I'm actually calling about a different order today. Um, yeah, I ordered, like, a coffee maker and it came in damaged, so just wanted to give you a heads-up.",
      "word_count": 37,
      "duration_seconds": 9.92,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0005",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 31.66,
      "end_seconds": 37.88,
      "text": "Okay, got it. Yeah, we'll, we'll keep that separate. Uh, do you have the order number for the coffee maker?",
      "word_count": 22,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0006",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 39,
      "end_seconds": 43.08,
      "text": "Yeah. Uh, this one ends in 4086.",
      "word_count": 7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0007",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 45.46,
      "end_seconds": 47.02,
      "text": "All right. Um, what's your email?",
      "word_count": 7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0008",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 48.26,
      "end_seconds": 61.08,
      "text": "Yeah, it's ethan.patel@northmail.com, N-O-R-T-H-M-A-I-L.com. And Patel, that's P-A-T-E-L.",
      "word_count": 26,
      "duration_seconds": 12.82,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0009",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 62.28,
      "end_seconds": 64.28,
      "text": "Okay, perfect. Give me one sec to check that out.",
      "word_count": 10,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0010",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 72.64,
      "end_seconds": 77.56,
      "text": "Okay. So I found a 12-cup coffee maker, matte black.",
      "word_count": 11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0011",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 79.12,
      "end_seconds": 81.66,
      "text": "What was wrong with it when you opened the box?",
      "word_count": 10,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0012",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 82.82,
      "end_seconds": 92.9,
      "text": "Uh, the water tank is cracked at the bottom, and the base was damp inside the plastic. Um, the outside wasn't beat up or anything, so yeah.",
      "word_count": 28,
      "duration_seconds": 10.08,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0013",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 93.78,
      "end_seconds": 99.18,
      "text": "Okay, got it. Have you tried turning it on or have you not?",
      "word_count": 13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0014",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 100.32,
      "end_seconds": 106.06,
      "text": "Uh, no, I haven't. Um, I stopped 'cause I saw the water and I thought I probably should, uh, call first.",
      "word_count": 22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.74,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0015",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 107.58,
      "end_seconds": 116.06,
      "text": "Yes, that's good. Um, let me check the return options on that item. So sorry again for your trouble. Would you rather replace it or get your money back?",
      "word_count": 30,
      "duration_seconds": 8.48,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0016",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 117.24,
      "end_seconds": 123.3,
      "text": "Uh, replace it, for sure, as long as I don't have to pay the current price. I saw it went up since I ordered it.",
      "word_count": 26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0017",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 125.32,
      "end_seconds": 136.3,
      "text": "Okay. A replacement would stay at the price you already paid. Um, just give me a minute to see whether it's in stock and whether the system wants it, uh, returned.",
      "word_count": 32,
      "duration_seconds": 10.98,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0018",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 136.38,
      "end_seconds": 136.84,
      "text": "Okay, yeah.",
      "word_count": 2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.46,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0019",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 139.14,
      "end_seconds": 140.71,
      "text": "Should just be about 20, 30 seconds now.",
      "word_count": 8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0020",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 141.94,
      "end_seconds": 142.16,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "word_count": 1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.22,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": true
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0021",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 153.74,
      "end_seconds": 161.8,
      "text": "Okay. So I just got back. The same model is available, and the estimated delivery is gonna be Thursday for this one.",
      "word_count": 22,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0022",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 163.58,
      "end_seconds": 169.04,
      "text": "The system is also waiving the return, so there's no label or any sort of drop-off.",
      "word_count": 18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0023",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 170.9,
      "end_seconds": 176.3,
      "text": "Oh, okay. Nice. Uh, yeah, that sounds good. Do you need pictures before you can send the replacement?",
      "word_count": 18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0024",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 178.16,
      "end_seconds": 188.44,
      "text": "No, um, not to process it. I could send you an optional photo link on the confirmation if you wanna document the condition, but it won't hold up your order in any way.",
      "word_count": 34,
      "duration_seconds": 10.28,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0025",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 190.06,
      "end_seconds": 196.5,
      "text": "Okay. Okay, yeah, I took, uh, some photos already just so, uh, just in case we needed it, so I'll probably just add them.",
      "word_count": 25,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0026",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 198.02,
      "end_seconds": 200.88,
      "text": "That's fine. Um, let me submit that replacement for you,",
      "word_count": 11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0027",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 203.14,
      "end_seconds": 209.02,
      "text": "and I will let you know in about 15 seconds as it's going through.",
      "word_count": 15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0028",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 211.2,
      "end_seconds": 212.94,
      "text": "Okay. It looks like it just went through.",
      "word_count": 8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0029",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 214.34,
      "end_seconds": 225.18,
      "text": "Okay. Okay. Oh, can you check where it's shipping to? Just because I don't want this to be tied to the pickup request from the headphone case, um, just 'cause there were some issues with that, too.",
      "word_count": 39,
      "duration_seconds": 10.84,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0030",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 226.38,
      "end_seconds": 235.04,
      "text": "Yes, that's a great question. So this one is going to your home address. Um, the pickup preference is only noted on yesterday's missing package case.",
      "word_count": 28,
      "duration_seconds": 8.66,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0031",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 236.78,
      "end_seconds": 243.16,
      "text": "Okay. Okay, yeah, th- that's perfect. I was worried the two orders would get m- mixed up together. Um, yeah.",
      "word_count": 21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0032",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 244.78,
      "end_seconds": 256.579,
      "text": "Yeah, no, um, in this case, they're completely separate. So I can see yesterday's case on the account, but I'm working only on the order which is 4086 right now.",
      "word_count": 33,
      "duration_seconds": 11.799,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0033",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 259.3,
      "end_seconds": 264.78,
      "text": "Okay, okay. And Thursday is the estimate. It's not, like, a guaranteed time window. Is that correct?",
      "word_count": 18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0034",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 265.94,
      "end_seconds": 274.22,
      "text": "Yes, that's correct. Um, it says right now Thursday by end of day. Um, once the carrier has it, you'll get the regular tracking updates.",
      "word_count": 27,
      "duration_seconds": 8.28,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0035",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 275.68,
      "end_seconds": 281.72,
      "text": "I see. Okay. Um, is it coming from the same warehouse as the damaged one?",
      "word_count": 15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0036",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 283.34,
      "end_seconds": 295.32,
      "text": "Unfortunately, I can't see where the first one was packaged. The replacement is signed to the Edison Distribution Center, but that can still change before it actually ships.",
      "word_count": 29,
      "duration_seconds": 11.98,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0037",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 297.26,
      "end_seconds": 303.44,
      "text": "Oh, okay. Okay. Yeah, no, I just mainly wanted to check you weren't, you know, resending the same kind of issue somehow.",
      "word_count": 23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0038",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 305.96,
      "end_seconds": 314.06,
      "text": "No, um, it'll be a brand-new shipment with a new order number. Um, this one will end in 8821.",
      "word_count": 21,
      "duration_seconds": 8.1,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0039",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 315.94,
      "end_seconds": 322.17,
      "text": "Okay. Okay, nice. Um, yeah, and what do I do with the damaged one since I don't need to, like, return it, I guess?",
      "word_count": 25,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0040",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 323.64,
      "end_seconds": 335.46,
      "text": "Yeah, so for the damaged one, uh, you can go ahead and discard that. Since there's moisture on the base, I definitely wouldn't plug it in. Other than that, um, Westline doesn't need it back.",
      "word_count": 38,
      "duration_seconds": 11.82,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0041",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 337.18,
      "end_seconds": 346.099,
      "text": "Oh, okay. Okay, and, uh, I can put it in, like, the electronics section? I'll check if my building has a electronic bin.",
      "word_count": 24,
      "duration_seconds": 8.919,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
