      "turn_id": "turn-0042",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 347.18,
      "end_seconds": 357.44,
      "text": "Yeah, that works. Um, I think that the city you're in may also have small appliance recycling, but the confirmation will simply show that the return was just waived.",
      "word_count": 30,
      "duration_seconds": 10.26,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0043",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 359.18,
      "end_seconds": 365.12,
      "text": "Oh, okay. Nice. Uh, okay, yeah, has the confirmation email gone out? I don't see it yet.",
      "word_count": 18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
