      "turn_id": "turn-0049",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 397.14,
      "end_seconds": 410.26,
      "text": "Okay. Okay, yeah, I'll, I'll definitely upload something. Um, no, this is great. Thank you. While I have you on the call, is there any updates on the, the headphones, uh, the other order that we had issues with?",
      "word_count": 41,
