      "turn_id": "turn-0051",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 427.68,
      "end_seconds": 432.34,
      "text": "Okay, okay. Uh, th- yeah, that's fine. I'll use the link tonight if nothing changes. That works.",
      "word_count": 19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0052",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 433.74,
      "end_seconds": 441.04,
      "text": "Okay, sounds good. So the coffee maker replacement is done, and the headphones case stays as is for now.",
      "word_count": 19,
      "duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0053",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 442.88,
      "end_seconds": 449.59,
      "text": "Okay. Okay, yeah, no, that, that sounds good for, for both. Uh, yeah, no, thank you so much again. I know,",
      "word_count": 21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0054",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 450.9,
      "end_seconds": 455.28,
      "text": "two different issues, uh, but I appreciate the support.",
      "word_count": 9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0055",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 455.36,
      "end_seconds": 465.74,
      "text": "You're so welcome, Ethan. Um, once again, so sorry for the trouble with the coffee maker as well as the order yesterday. Um, I hope that the next delivery that we have for you goes a little bit more smoothly.",
      "word_count": 41,
      "duration_seconds": 10.38,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
